<p>When you fire your metalstar, your also establish a psionic bloodlink with the shrapnel still inside for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 4, 5, 6, 6</acronym> turns.</p><p>Each turn the victims are drained for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">25, 34, 41, 47, 52</acronym> physical damage, half of which heals you (each additional victim healing is reduced by half).</p><p>If the victim move more than twice away from the radius of Metalstar (currently 2) the effect stops.</p><p>This damage does not break daze and increases with your Steampower.</p>